    "catalog:category": "sanitary",
    "catalog:placement": "free",
    "catalog:lod": "300",
    "catalog:tags": "bidet, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Floor-standing back-to-wall bidet. rim 0.40. The rim and bowl are one ring, a D of radius 0.185 with a round bowl of radius 0.14, drawn as two straight sweeps that meet a rear body at the wall; the ring stands on a pedestal of the same D set 0.03 in, whose face is the bowl floor. A pillar mixer 0.08 high on the rear deck makes the overall height 0.48; it builds as a prism.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice, verify; EN 14528 for bidets), not read, unverified: bidet 0.37 x 0.56 x 0.40. Ring, bowl and pedestal sizes are the author's. Ports BS EN 12056-2 via the drafting standard, not read, unverified",
